    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>descripcion</span>\" => \"<span class=sf-dump-str title=\"125 characters\">Enjoy this wonderful tour around the capital of the Inca empire, known as the navel of the world. The imperial city of Cusco.</span>\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>contenido</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">&lt;h2&gt;City tour in the city of Cusco&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Cusco is considered a cosmopolitan city due to the large number of travelers from around the world. It is a city that retains strong roots in its Andean history and culture, making it unique and special. Cusco was the ancient capital of the Inca Empire and contains a great deal of history and cultural heritage.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">&lt;p&gt;In addition, the city of Cusco has a vibrant cultural life, with traditional festivals and celebrations throughout the year, such as the Inti Raymi (Festival of the Sun) and the Cusco Carnival. It is also known for its delicious Peruvian cuisine, which includes dishes such as ceviche, lomo saltado, and aj&amp;iacute; de gallina.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"935 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Pacha Mama Spirit offers a day for you to dedicate to getting to know the city of Cusco, visiting places such as the fortress of Sacsayhuaman, the main cathedral of Cusco, the temple of Qoricancha, among other special places.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>resumen</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\">&lt;h2&gt;Order of activities for Cusco city tour:&lt;/h2&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\">&lt;ol&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;1. The fortress of Sacsayhuaman&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;2. Lunch&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;3. Temple of Qoricancha&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;4. Inka Historical Museum&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default\">\\t</span>&lt;li&gt;5. The main cathedral of Cusco&lt;/li&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\">&lt;/ol&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"300 characters\">&lt;p&gt;The approximate duration of the tour is 6 hours.&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>detallado</span>\" => \"\"\"
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\">&lt;p&gt;This tour starts in the early hours of the day, between 8:00am and 10:00am, according to your preference. We will pick you up from your hotel and take you to the transportation that will take us on a guided visit to the &lt;strong&gt;Sacsayhuaman&lt;/strong&gt; fortress. Once we finish exploring this wonderful place, we will head to the restaurant reserved for lunch. After lunch, we will walk through the streets of Cusco and visit the main &lt;strong&gt;cathedral&lt;/strong&gt;, where we will learn about its interesting history and construction.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\">&lt;p&gt;Next, we will visit the Qoricancha temple, where we can observe the blend of the ancient Inca and Spanish cultures in this beautiful building. We will end our tour with a visit to the Inka Museum, which will allow us to learn more about the ancient life and customs of the &lt;strong&gt;Inca Empire.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\">&lt;p&gt;We will then return you to your hotel. The approximate duration of the tour is 6 hours.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"962 characters\">&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
    \"<span class=sf-dump-key>incluidos</span>\" => \"\"\"
